- 输出改为：\n  - `UnitTestSpec.md`\n  - `unit_test_book.xlsx`\n  - 以及中间件 `design_rules.json` / `code_rules.json` / `cases.json`\n\n3) **SKILL.md 已对齐为单一真相**\n- 文件：`skills/web-unit-testbook/SKILL.md`\n- 现在明确：\n  - 只认 `run_pipeline.py` 作为入口\n  - 支持 `--mode`\n  - 标准产物命名与目录规范\n\n4) **收敛总结文档已补齐**\n- 新增：`skills/web-unit-testbook/WALKTHROUGH.md`\n\n5) **历史数据目录迁移**\n- 已建立并迁移到工作区根目录：\n  - `runs/`\n  - `samples/`\n- 技能内 `workspace/inputs` 已清空为占位 `.gitkeep`（不再堆历史数据）\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 已提交 commit\n\n- **commit**: `52a46bd`\n- **message**: `web-unit-testbook: unify pipeline entry with --mode and update docs`\n\n---\n\n### 现在可直接用的命令\n\n高精度（推荐）：\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision\n```\n\n快速 UI：\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode ui-only\n```\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以再补一个“**最短命令（默认 template 路径）**”版本，进一步减少输入参数。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0885b6744fd551640169b8d072dc088191bf736590ee3917ee\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":220,"output":587,"cacheRead":31872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32679,"cost":{"input":0.000385,"output":0.008218,"cacheRead":0.005577599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014180599999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773719662715}}
