，所以这条链路要你提供 `--code <code_dir_or_zip>`。\n\n---\n\n关于你问的“知识库”：\n\n- **技能文档知识**：有了（`SKILL.md` + `WALKTHROUGH.md` 已对齐）。\n- **项目业务知识库/额外参考库**：目前没有看到单独的 KB 目录（如果你要，我可以再给它补一个 `references/` 知识库结构）。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fee526ef23d36470169b8d0cb0f388191a05b1a3809155c18\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":749,"output":311,"cacheRead":31360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32420,"cost":{"input":0.00131075,"output":0.004354,"cacheRead":0.005488,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01115275}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773719754276}}
