vSJ7wLgPdmZ30ZY0Da5WyseLoU8J9FZwZtWLwe4MS0AE7aiqHqQU1O35vwWO6TgVMHLA9iHCBMxfam0RM_iJ35sHdeEhJR0fDVrulJu_SQ7ivOermHH0QnUvWrSuAwb8ClOOPLJF2Ln4stU_f47Uy6KfPZB9rj8DZfRR3WVisqELcFq8ah1ZNru6PnfA5IW7-RjpD3ZyzaeTNZU6--9ba2omgkiXC6GiavjcuuhPiaDBxdxBTirPPiA3zjkgIF1xKU4fQTcMftzOsYwxW3SRKPaTtiA5-RXvJ5taz7doPbDfzFhvoUHgcrtNFJogVvxU9UmsE=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Adding references support and updating docs**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"俺也去你补好，做成标准可扩展的 `references/` 知识库入口，后面你直接往里丢“单体测试书参考模板/规范说明”就行。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_006b1f6a75379ae80169b8d12caccc8191a5e7e3aabab0ce47\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Y1UD22GlEn0WevZkEknmQ8KX|fc_006b1f6a75379ae80169b8d1367cac8191a5eecf0dc443940b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path \"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\\references\" | Out-Null; New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path \"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\\references\\templates\" | Out-Null; New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path \"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\\references\\rules\" | Out-Null"},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\references\\\" | Out-Null; New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\references\\\\templates\\\" | Out-Null; New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\references\\\\rules\\\" | Out-Null\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ZfTcUY3FDDyeZGLpqaUMWr3G|fc_006b1f6a75379ae80169b8d1367cb8819196fd93ed5c851ed1","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\\references\\knowledge-base.md","content":"# web-unit-testbook 知识库（references）\n\n把你长期复用的“单体测试书知识”放在这里，作为生成前的参考依据。\n\n## 目录约定\n\n- `templates/`：参考模板（结构样例、字段示例、命名规范示例）\n- `rules/`：规则文档（覆盖策略、边界值策略、异常分层、术语表）\n\n## 推荐内容\n\n1. 单体测试书标准章节与字段说明\n2. 测试用例编号规则（例如 UT-画面ID-序号）\n3. 判定结果（OK/NG）与证据记录规范\n4. 常见业务校验模式（必填、长度、格式、相互依赖）\n5. API 输入输出断言模板\n\n## 使用建议\n\n- 把“稳定不变的规范”放到这里，不放运行产物。\n- 文件命名尽量语义化：\n  - `rules/case-numbering.md`\n  - `rules/assertion-style.md`\n  - `templates/unit-testbook-structure.md`\n- 当你更新规范时，优先改 references，再执行生成。\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\references\\\\knowledge-base.md\",\"content\":\"# web-unit-testbook 知识库（references）\\n\\n把你长期复用的“单体测试书知识”放在这里，作为生成前的参考依据。\\n\\n## 目录约定\\n\\n- `templates/`：参考模板（结构样例、字段示例、命名规范示例）\\n- `rules/`：规则文档（覆盖策略、边界值策略、异常分层、术语表）\\n\\n## 推荐内容\\n\\n1. 单体测试书标准章节与字段说明\\n2. 测试用例编号规则（例如 UT-画面ID-序号）\\n3. 判定结果（OK/NG）与证据记录规范\\n4. 常见业务校验模式（必填、长度、格式、相互依赖）\\n5. API 输入输出断言模板\\n\\n## 使用建议\\n\\n- 把“稳定不变的规范”放到这里，不放运行产物。\\n- 文件命名尽量语义化：\\n  - `rules/case-numbering.md`\\n  - `rules/assertion-style.md`\\n  - `templates/unit-testbook-structure.md`\\n- 当你更新规范时，优先改 references，再执行生成。\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_LVdiasQGgZcaI9KEsxJKd3NE|fc_006b1f6a75379ae80169b8d1367cc08191a2950a07daa07ef0","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\\references\\templates\\.gitkeep","content":""},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\references\\\\templates\\\\.gitkeep\",\"content\":\"\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3nci9Sk8eYihJ20yZvxoZoev|fc_006b1f6a75379ae80169b8d1367cc4819193dcbf4a131ee7c8","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\\references\\rules\\.gitkeep","content":""},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\references\\\\rules\\\\.gitkeep\",\"content\":\"\"}"}],"api":"opena