":0,"total":0.0068474}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773719874686}}
{"type":"message","id":"e33f6df3","parentId":"8ab03f90","timestamp":"2026-03-17T03:57:57.845Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Ddm81uaxOLX1ebBt4WlV1UHS|fc_006b1f6a75379ae80169b8d14422148191ab2d6fca4a34ad8b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: web-unit-testbook\ndescription: Generate web page unit test books from detailed design Excel files, embedded images/OCR text, LWC/Apex source code, and a user-provided Excel template. Use when user asks to read design docs, extract field/API/check rules, parse code branches and data bindings, generate test cases, and fill a unit test book template (.xlsx).\n---\n\n# Web Unit Test Book Generator\n\nUse `scripts/run_pipeline.py` as the single entry point.\n\n## Modes\n\n- `high-precision` (default): parse design + code, then generate deeply merged test cases.\n- `ui-only`: parse design only, then generate UI-focused test cases quickly.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Design workbook (`.xlsx`) with field definitions, API names, validation notes, optional screenshots.\n- Code folder or zip (`--code`) for `high-precision` mode.\n- Unit test template workbook (`.xlsx`) (default: `workspace/samples/template/template_v3_confirmed.xlsx`).\n\n## Command\n\nRun from this skill directory:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> [--mode ui-only]\n```\n\nHigh precision (recommended when code is available):\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision\n```\n\n## Standard outputs (in `--outdir`)\n\n- `design_rules.json`\n- `code_rules.json` (high-precision only)\n- `cases.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\n- `unit_test_book.xlsx`\n\n## Workspace data layout\n\n- Historical runs: `workspace/runs/`\n- Sample inputs: `workspace/samples/`\n- Keep skill directory free of historical run/output datasets.\n"}],"isError":false,"timest