id":"call_hywdCbt86GTm1LombS8LRfBn|fc_0ab2bf9ef8919b110169b8d2a08c4c8191b0b6826953071530","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\\SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1851,"output":159,"cacheRead":25088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27098,"cost":{"input":0.00323925,"output":0.002226,"cacheRead":0.0043904,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00985565}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773720222437}}
{"type":"message","id":"cdcc4770","parentId":"9085167a","timestamp":"2026-03-17T04:03:47.408Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_hywdCbt86GTm1LombS8LRfBn|fc_0ab2bf9ef8919b110169b8d2a08c4c8191b0b6826953071530","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: web-unit-testbook\ndescription: Generate web page unit test books from detailed design Excel files, embedded images/OCR text, LWC/Apex source code, and a user-provided Excel template. Use when user asks to read design docs, extract field/API/check rules, parse code branches and data bindings, generate test cases, and fill a unit test book template (.xlsx).\n---\n\n# Web Unit Test Book Generator\n\nUse `scripts/run_pipeline.py` as the single entry point.\n\n## Modes\n\n- `high-precision` (default): parse design + code, then generate deeply merged test cases.\n- `ui-only`: parse design only, then generate UI-focused test cases quickly.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Design workbook (`.xlsx`) with field definitions, API names, validation notes, optional screenshots.\n- Code folder or zip (`--code`) for `high-precision` mode.\n- Unit test template workbook (`.xlsx`) (default: `workspace/samples/template/template_v3_confirmed.xlsx`).\n\n## Command\n\nRun from this skill directory:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> [--mode ui-only]\n```\n\nHigh precision (recommended when code is available):\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision\n```\n\n## Standard outputs (in `--outdir`)\n\n- `design_rules.json`\n- `code_rules.json` (high-precision only)\n- `cases.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\n- `unit_test_book.xlsx`\n\n## Workspace data layout\n\n- Historical runs: `runs/` (workspace root)\n- Sample inputs: `samples/` (workspace root)\n- Keep skill directory free of historical run/output datasets.\n\n## Knowledge base (references)\n\nStore stable test-book knowledge under `references/`:\n\n- `references/templates/`: structural template examples and field mapping notes\n- `references/rules/`: case strategy, assertion style, naming standards, terminology\n- `references/knowledge-base.md`: index and curation guide\n\nWhen generation quality drifts, update `references/` first, then re-run pipeline.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773720227406}}
{"type":"message","id":"cd5c4097","parentId":"cdcc4770","timestamp":"2026-03-17T04:03:53.382Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0ab2bf9ef8919b110169b8d2a2c0e081919b323085dfca6443\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuNKjoHn42K8pGGIqnKjxJ2ySKG8IJLen98JJ7Ty-9DhbhauT6azu1CITyOPTKlQyiDCTElFOUXJgJPNXGhN0nkaiHnBc-jYOCBVWcdpMtThKTRmwQja0srGFp50HkSn8HEcQa6I4Uf0H3kDgzVTl0pnh9olKZ-M6Vncfp2qxV0CKf2UgQUNneLUwRQFpU--CuOcYEAjbSK3_uDlvcEd_-wZXhJIksIJGRdf9k-xlQjX4OGnDOYT6h6HaQ8RP1hWk5LciKo2GLUDnaHR-bfhdw02YSBaCJG9RYkW3NLlkJHLmIouT_rxjoKCK126Z9_foTHQ1Zy-yRFXwUv4-xM95nzD35-ICqkyQ8hhh97VI1LTFqOOu3b7DABj6517Y2SGmJxydRa8p7qg4rz20z5BvR0IuCy4jIRNAGpwZU2EouGpbtvz7jk-wGuzwBaymv51w2uNNsmR7JabKoNge9LCkpx9Cj60hSwZtEW_6Dwy8N_u0oxZblf9kLH11MvQ8bw7Zw7uTooFjbUiV7Nf4X6ruVN2TpD0gOuBdu4ISwGvthrjrwpyKVS5E8JqQTMUQ5EI7tLFAr8Gyo9zfORFQGb0KwXLdQSVX9LYYOcHxvkP1y7Q2KAHpmkFJFqUmi4INkfTBzKmF2_ulVV0uD0MU66wm8haNLEf-TjtGRP6_oSG-fP6qQsJbXmpmEht6Flbig6WIqSfEogPGq_I1U8vkgVW_uo9PF1N2JAv9INP0SbWbgBnd1QqHotoguFbVn-5wqowkJUwAzxyWLhkhp6-_c2o6sG11XUju5cu2YCTxVgoq6duFNy3DNFEV-QWKuGJQevMiI0VmbmCAnSAicBRXeu-mpP71mGmTI1yJd_iJqMXAbxzHIjJzLza-5SV2_sMAGRob0yJCKVtrQsA9P1cHfrMADc-xI9I7z2swrY3Em2YeYjMYWAm3fHmjZFp4OIZqzFSjMCXyL3CdGBjWZLCgyvEes7cQLQ==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]你现在给我这几样就能开跑：\n\n### 必需（最少）\n1. **设计书 Excel**（`.xlsx`）  \n   - 页面字段、校验规则、API 名、业务说明越完整越好  \n2. **模板 Excel**（`.xlsx`）  \n   - 你希望输出长什么样（你刚放进 references 的那两份就可用）\n\n### 高精度模式再加一项（推荐）\n3. **代码包**（代码目录或 `.zip`）  \n   - 用于把分支逻辑、字段绑定、后端校验也并入用例\n\n---\n\n### 你可以二选一\n- **快速版（UI-only）**：只给 1 + 2  \n- **完整版（high-precision）**：给 1 + 2 + 3\n\n---\n\n### 我这边会产出\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\n- `unit_test_book.xlsx`\n- `cases.json`（中间结果）\n\n---\n\n你直接把这次要跑的文件路径发我（设计书、模板、代码包），我马上帮你生成。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ab2bf9ef8919b110169b8d2a3922881919181ab446130110c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":829,"output":280,"cacheRead":26752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27861,"cost":{"input":0.00145075,"output":0.00392,"cacheRead":0.0046816,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01005235}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773720227409}}
