{"type":"message","id":"1d9569aa","parentId":"5a565547","timestamp":"2026-03-17T05:43:44.916Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0bee81b56bd2970d0169b8ea0ad4708191b6be69bea51b235c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuOoLT2t6ED7fvZ9TDEbLl4PL8P6sFtByDoQdG2eOruAeU4g5ac2200VYOcY7fmZbcRHywI7sue9RNL28khitBOVTS5fnsOCitbaSvIK9EwFrXyEWC9-mMsGBqm3eXtltR2mObSRCdZf4zy6bN4sMlwr4XVDWJ421P-DpMfVYGk8HCFf0jDLVGsRXzjYA4HyK2ihrT_9fA0QCNDhjYIlCBaGCyxyU2_2hPd2jGxKjQDln4hntZ4F7AJqKtzOp1dmOELhjPBMosdOUvnG4nE6Q2rv0AXDLNJyoS-s8E7BejgKqsw72V-6HiVSvlrqFhvhp7io9dyqBClmydtsXZZYDKLGFCV6RrQUIzm6oiNCLzkXGScHzjK-5E24plSLCM-lBIwqX0eaY976bx-d9kMLaZn29HuuuVsRZ9ehp2sgE4TQsyLCIKvRILE51YmJypW_IM-jps6rMfNobNM1mqLKLZtSwQgi3BvYKCWgDmGrcuQ0iXsR_Z--0J11DB0YSQeNPb91AQ83M-Ziiy4RGFFos3XWXonJYdLH6bjs8N0wa1tdYMGy7OQkHHIwmdOSHwU5A0IeFFOXf8qgliokpFC6xSCTonlmxpM0Z9yxibif64BE7QfCUIgBgfV9TTRMzBOGIT84QEbyXtgsNhVAp3ImW47HhYYkDvr9GiLEasaqUvYX52OqHAFVoA88-RLiRhw0e6onAUopn47QU0bBrRu6a-XsecTn3xSMNZB2shO0fDYb9MPunnaZquxio6zzWdY6UpZO8Ug3KVRJe3TGVVhu-CEOEnX6eyV7fKxolGcZPRJyYxjTX9a0nZrA8p8-B4_gY_eEstZLaPw4Arty15y1wvZdBolwxERk5AQHrJ9VFQtC-5lLrqdGYVOc9PexpIiXRaI6X\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]对，你这个提醒对。  \n不应该只剩“正常系”。\n\n我建议改成这版最实用范围（你看是否OK）：\n\n1. **正常系**（必做）  \n2. **画面遷移/按钮动作系**（确认返回、确认、提交、完成页）  \n3. **文言/表示確認**（文案、标签、标题）  \n4. **轻量异常系**（只保留你模板里已有的异常场景，不扩展新的复杂check）\n\n也就是：**不做重度规则校验扩写**，但也不把异常系全砍掉。  \n这样最接近你现有模板风格。\n\n你回我：**“按这4类做”**，我就按这个范围执行。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0bee81b56bd2970d0169b8ea0b522481918b22a91e4aac464b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":345,"output":197,"cacheRead":56192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56734,"cost":{"input":0.00060375,"output":0.002758,"cacheRead":0.0098336,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01319535}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773726219309}}
