 code + merge generation\n- `ui-only`: design-only fast generation\n\n## Stable export policy (default)\n\n`--export-mode template-first` is default and should be kept for template-driven projects.\n\nBehavior:\n- Keep existing template rows/style (do not overwrite existing step wording by default)\n- Fill aligned rows semantically (mainly `テスト条件` / `想定結果`)\n- Append unmatched generated cases after the template data block\n\nTuning:\n- `--data-start-row` (default `8`)\n- `--match-threshold` (default `0.20`)\n\nUse `--export-mode append` only for blank/new templates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `--design` design workbook (`.xlsx`)\n- `--code` code folder/zip (required in `high-precision`)\n- `--template` output template workbook (`.xlsx`)\n- `--outdir` output directory\n\n## Command\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision\n```\n\nTemplate-first with explicit controls:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision --export-mode template-first --data-start-row 8 --match-threshold 0.20\n```\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `design_rules.json`\n- `code_rules.json` (high-precision)\n- `cases.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\n- `unit_test_book.xlsx`\n\n## References\n\n- `references/knowledge-base.md`\n- `references/templates/`\n- `references/rules/`\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\SKILL.md\",\"content\":\"---\\nname: web-unit-testbook\\ndescription: Generate web unit test books from design Excel + code (zip/folder) + user template. Use when user needs template-aligned test-case generation (STEP flow style), long-term stable export behavior, and reproducible .xlsx output.\\n---\\n\\n# Web Unit Test Book\\n\\nUse `scripts/run_pipeline.py` as the only entry.\\n\\n## Modes\\n\\n- `high-precision` (default): design + code + merge generation\\n- `ui-only`: design-only fast generation\\n\\n## Stable export policy (default)\\n\\n`--export-mode template-first` is default and should be kept for template-driven projects.\\n\\nBehavior:\\n- Keep existing template rows/style (do not overwrite existing step wording by default)\\n- Fill aligned rows semantically (mainly `テスト条件` / `想定結果`)\\n- Append unmatched generated cases after the template data block\\n\\nTuning:\\n- `--data-start-row` (default `8`)\\n- `--match-threshold` (default `0.20`)\\n\\nUse `--export-mode append` only for blank/new templates.\\n\\n## Inputs\\n\\n- `--design` design workbook (`.xlsx`)\\n- `--code` code folder/zip (required in `high-precision`)\\n- `--template` output template workbook (`.xlsx`)\\n- `--outdir` output directory\\n\\n## Command\\n\\n```powershell\\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision\\n```\\n\\nTemplate-first with explicit controls:\\n\\n```powershell\\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision --export-mode template-first --data-start-row 8 --match-threshold 0.20\\n```\\n\\n## Outputs\\n\\n- `design_rules.json`\\n- `code_rules.json` (high-precision)\\n- `cases.json`\\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\\n- `unit_test_book.xlsx`\\n\\n## References\\n\\n- `references/knowledge-base.md`\\n- `references/templates/`\\n- `references/rules/`\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":477,"output":569,"cacheRead":44544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45590,"cost":{"input":0.00083475,"output":0.007965999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0077951999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.016595949999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773728491479}}
