ted.\n4. Append unmatched generated cases after existing template data rows.\n5. Mark low-confidence AI-only fills for manual review when possible.\n\n## Recommended defaults\n\n- export mode: `template-first`\n- data start row: `8`\n- match threshold: `0.20`\n\n## When to use append mode\n\nUse `append` only when template is blank or user explicitly requests full overwrite-style export.\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\references\\\\rules\\\\template-first-policy.md\",\"content\":\"# Template-First Policy\\n\\nUse for projects where the provided unit-test template already contains curated step wording.\\n\\n## Rules\\n\\n1. Preserve existing template rows and wording first.\\n2. Prefer filling empty `テスト条件` and `想定結果` cells on aligned rows.\\n3. Avoid rewriting `確認手順` unless explicitly requested.\\n4. Append unmatched generated cases after existing template data rows.\\n5. Mark low-confidence AI-only fills for manual review when possible.\\n\\n## Recommended defaults\\n\\n- export mode: `template-first`\\n- data start row: `8`\\n- match threshold: `0.20`\\n\\n## When to use append mode\\n\\nUse `append` only when template is blank or user explicitly requests full overwrite-style export.\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1086,"output":241,"cacheRead":44544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45871,"cost":{"input":0.0019005,"output":0.003374,"cacheRead":0.0077951999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0130697}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773728505439}}
