rules/template-first-policy.md`\n\n### 提交信息\n- **commit**: `b380283`\n- **message**: `web-unit-testbook: add template-first stable export policy`\n\n---\n\n如果你同意，我下一步就直接按这套新规则跑你这份三件套，先出**可审阅版**（不直接覆盖最终版）。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_043c2c29dbb2a2f40169b8f316c5ac81919426fd6662c773fb\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":681,"output":329,"cacheRead":46592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47602,"cost":{"input":0.0011917499999999999,"output":0.004606,"cacheRead":0.0081536,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013951350000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773728533853}}
